{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47664","headline":"题四明金鹅寺壁 · 吕岩","name":"题四明金鹅寺壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方丈有门出不钥，见个山童露双脚。\n问伊方丈何寂寥，道是虚空也不着。\n闻此语，何欣欣，主翁岂是寻常人。\n我来谒见不得见，谒心耿耿生埃尘。\n归去也，波浩渺，路入蓬莱山杳杳。\n相思一上石楼时，雪晴海阔千峰晓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}